        "section": "mechanical",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "03 - Heat Transfer",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nNusselt:    Nu = hL/k        (dimensionless convection coefficient, ratio of convective to conductive)\nReynolds:   Re = ρvL/μ       (inertia/viscous in fluid)\nPrandtl:    Pr = c_p μ/k = ν/α  (momentum diffusivity/thermal diffusivity)\nGrashof:    Gr = gβΔTL³/ν²  (buoyancy/viscous, for natural convection)\nRayleigh:   Ra = Gr × Pr     (natural convection parameter)"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-HEAT-TRANSFER.md#033",
      "path": [
        "03-HEAT-TRANSFER.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:mechanical:03-heat-transfer, git-history:mechanical:03-heat-transfer]",
