        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[heat, transfer]",
        "section": "mechanical",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "03 - Heat Transfer",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Useful form: Nu = C Re^m Pr^n  (forced convection correlations all have this form)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-HEAT-TRANSFER.md#034",
      "path": [
