        "root_concepts": "[heat, transfer]",
        "section": "mechanical",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "03 - Heat Transfer",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Prandtl number intuition:**\n- Pr ≪ 1 (liquid metals: Pr ~ 0.003–0.03): thermal BL >> velocity BL\n- Pr ≈ 1 (gases: Pr ~ 0.7): similar thicknesses\n- Pr ≫ 1 (viscous oils: Pr ~ 100–10,000): velocity BL >> thermal BL"
    },
